      "basis": "Implementation required to apply scene-color rendering to DOM HUD; verified layout cache, overlay cleanup and resize behavior. No new gameplay timing rules"
    },
    {
      "change": "Migrate former bundled fkh material setting",
      "basis": "User explicitly requested replacing the previous imitation skin; other imported material packs retained"
    },
    {
      "change": "Non-blocking Disabled/Residual and Ready noise draw below chart notes, while Active/contaminated-finger overlay remains above HUD",
      "basis": "User observation and requested layering; original DisabledBlock One/One and ReadyBlock SrcAlpha/One blend states from extracted shader data. Original fill colors/opacities are unchanged.",
